  s3Title: '3. Data processed by the Service',
  s3Body1: 'When you use WhoUnfollowed, the data you provide (your Instagram, Threads or TikTok export file) is processed exclusively within your own browser using client-side JavaScript. No file contents, follower lists, usernames, or any portion of the data export are transmitted to our servers at any time during the analysis process. From an Instagram export, the Service reads only the followers, following, pending follow requests, and recently unfollowed lists. From a Threads export, the Service reads only the followers, following, and recently unfollowed lists (threads/followers.json, threads/following.json, threads/recently_unfollowed_profiles.json). Other files in the same ZIP, such as your posts, likes, photos, and personal information, are never read, unless you subscribe to Pro AI and choose to let the coach learn from your export (see section 5). From a TikTok download, the Service keeps only the follower and following lists (from user_data_tiktok.json, or the Follower and Following text files in the TXT format). The rest of that download, such as your videos, comments, and messages, is not used and never leaves your browser.',
